units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic
lattice fcc 4.05
region box block 0 5 0 5 0 5
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Al
mass 1 26.9815
velocity all create 300 12345 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
timestep 0.001
fix 1 all npt temp 300 300 0.1 iso 1.01325 1.01325 1
thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step temp press vol pe ke etotal
run 500000
